window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-3b6d55bd01328040"]={"zh":"<h1 id=\"chatgpt-voice\">ChatGPT Voice</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>由 GPT-Live 驱动的 ChatGPT Voice 让你可以在 ChatGPT 桌面应用的 Chat、Work 和 Codex 中交流想法、协调任务。无需切换回打字，就能开始工作、查看进展或调整方向。</p> <p>ChatGPT Plus、Pro、Business、Edu 和 Enterprise 方案均可在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中使用 ChatGPT Voice。Enterprise 和 Edu 用户会先进入为期两周的提前体验期，之后该功能才会默认开放。将手机与桌面主机配对后，也可以通过 <a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f?anchor=set-up-mobile-access\">iOS 版 Codex</a> 使用 ChatGPT Voice。功能是否可用还取决于推出进度和工作区设置。请参阅<a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=feature-availability\">功能可用性</a>。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图说明：可通过麦克风和扬声器控件进行交互的 ChatGPT Voice 对话。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-talking\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">开始对话</h2> <ol> <li>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中打开你想讨论的 Codex 任务，或新建聊天或任务。</li> <li>在现有任务中选择 <strong>开始语音聊天（Start voice chat）</strong>，或在新聊天或任务中选择 <strong>开始新语音聊天（Start new voice chat）</strong>。</li> <li>首次开始语音聊天时，请允许使用麦克风、选择语音；在 macOS 上还要检查屏幕上下文设置。</li> <li>开始说话。结束时选择 <strong>停止语音聊天（Stop voice chat）</strong>。</li> </ol> <p>现有 Codex 任务中的语音功能正在逐步推出。功能开放后，你可以在已通过文字开始的任务中开始语音交流。语音会使用该任务的对话和所选模型来处理请求，因此你可以直接讨论任务进度或调整方向，无需另开任务。</p> <p>如果现有任务中没有 <strong>开始语音聊天（Start voice chat）</strong>，请更新桌面应用以及运行该任务的 Codex 主机。是否可用还取决于你的账户和工作区。你仍可以在支持的场景中新开语音聊天，或使用<a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-voice-dictation\">语音听写</a>将语音转成提示文本。要继续之前的语音聊天，请打开它并选择 <strong>开始语音聊天（Start voice chat）</strong>。</p> <p>你可以在 <strong>设置 &gt; 语音 &gt; 语音聊天快捷键（Settings &gt; Voice &gt; Voice chat hotkey）</strong> 中设置快捷键。</p> <p><a id=\"have-a-conversation\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">进行对话</h2> <p>ChatGPT Voice 支持自然轮流交谈。ChatGPT 回复时，你可以打断它、追问或调整方向。如果 ChatGPT 开始执行任务，你可以继续说话来查看进度或引导工作。</p> <p><a id=\"delegate-and-coordinate-work\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">委派和协调工作</h2> <p>ChatGPT Voice 可以为较长的工作创建独立任务、查看现有任务并发送后续指示。它会把进展、阻碍和结果带回语音对话，让你在工作继续进行时仍能继续交流。</p> <p>例如：</p> <ul> <li>“检查今天的发布简报，并总结需要批准的决定。”</li> <li>“启动一个 Codex 任务来运行测试，并调查任何未通过的测试。”</li> <li>“检查正在进行的任务，并总结其中阻碍进展的问题。”</li> </ul> <p>你还可以要求切换到另一个 Codex 任务交谈，然后再返回之前的任务。例如，你可以说：“让我和负责检查测试的任务聊一下”，然后说：“带我回到之前的任务。”目标任务必须支持语音，并且需要位于已连接的主机上且当前可用。</p> <p>ChatGPT Voice 遵循其在 Chat、Work 和 ChatGPT 桌面应用中的 Codex 任务所采用的相同<a href=\"#/article/a-907da152b64948d8\">权限设置</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"show-chatgpt-what-you-see\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt\">向 ChatGPT 展示你看到的内容</h2> <p>在 macOS 上，你可以在 <strong>设置 &gt; 语音（Settings &gt; Voice）</strong> 中开启 <strong>屏幕上下文（Screen context）</strong>，然后说“看一下这个”。ChatGPT 可以截取你最前端窗口的 <a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38?anchor=permissions-and-safety\">appshot</a> 并将其作为上下文。你的组织可以禁用此功能。</p> <p>appshot 可能包含窗口图像和可访问的文本，包括当前滚动区域之外的内容。macOS 可能会请求 <strong>屏幕与系统音频录制</strong>及<strong>辅助功能</strong>权限。请勿分享含有敏感信息的窗口，包括可视滚动区域之外的文本。</p> <p><a id=\"chatgpt-voice-and-voice-dictation\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-voice_1\">ChatGPT Voice 与语音听写</h2> <p>使用 ChatGPT Voice 进行实时语音对话。如果你只想在发送前将语音转换为提示文本，请使用<a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-voice-dictation\">语音听写</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"limits-and-troubleshooting\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">限制与故障排除</h2> <p>ChatGPT 桌面应用中同一时间只能有一个语音聊天处于活动状态。如果无法开始语音聊天，请确认你的方案、推出进度和工作区是否支持 ChatGPT Voice；然后检查麦克风权限，并确认其他应用窗口中没有正在进行的语音聊天。如果屏幕上下文不可用，请检查 <strong>设置 &gt; 语音（Settings &gt; Voice）</strong>、Appshots 权限以及组织限制。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"chatgpt-voice\">ChatGPT Voice</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Powered by GPT-Live, ChatGPT Voice lets you talk through ideas and coordinate tasks in Chat, Work, and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app. Start work, check progress, or change direction without switching back to typing.</p> <p>ChatGPT Voice is available in the ChatGPT desktop app with ChatGPT Plus, Pro, Business, Edu, and Enterprise plans. Enterprise and Edu availability begins with a two-week early-access period before the feature becomes available by default. You can also use ChatGPT Voice through <a href=\"#/article/a-171fdaa74f75310f?anchor=set-up-mobile-access\">Codex on iOS</a> after pairing your phone with a desktop host. Availability also depends on rollout status and workspace settings. See <a href=\"#/article/a-24e0a6ab1e90e5b7?anchor=feature-availability\">feature availability</a>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Interactive ChatGPT Voice conversation with microphone and speaker controls.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"start-talking\">Start talking</h2> <ol> <li>Open the Codex task you want to discuss in the ChatGPT desktop app, or start a new chat or task.</li> <li>Select <strong>Start voice chat</strong> in an existing task, or <strong>Start new voice chat</strong> in a new chat or task.</li> <li>The first time you start a voice chat, allow microphone access, choose a voice, and review screen context on macOS.</li> <li>Start talking. Select <strong>Stop voice chat</strong> when you finish.</li> </ol> <p>Voice in existing Codex tasks is rolling out. When available, you can start talking in a task that began with typed messages. Voice uses that task's conversation and selected model to carry out your requests, so you can discuss its progress or change direction without starting another task.</p> <p>If <strong>Start voice chat</strong> isn't available in an existing task, update the desktop app and the Codex host running the task. Availability also depends on your account and workspace. You can still start a new voice chat where supported, or use <a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-voice-dictation\">voice dictation</a> to enter prompt text. To resume an earlier voice chat, open it and select <strong>Start voice chat</strong>.</p> <p>You can set a shortcut in <strong>Settings &gt; Voice &gt; Voice chat hotkey</strong>.</p> <h2 id=\"have-a-conversation\">Have a conversation</h2> <p>ChatGPT Voice supports natural turn-taking. You can interrupt ChatGPT during a response, ask a follow-up, or change direction. If ChatGPT starts work, keep talking to check progress or steer the task.</p> <h2 id=\"delegate-and-coordinate-work\">Delegate and coordinate work</h2> <p>ChatGPT Voice can start separate tasks for longer work, check existing tasks, and send follow-up instructions. It brings progress, blockers, and results back to your voice conversation so you can keep talking while work continues.</p> <p>For example:</p> <ul> <li>“Review today's launch brief and summarize decisions that need approval.”</li> <li>“Start a Codex task to run the tests and investigate anything that doesn't pass.”</li> <li>“Check active tasks and summarize anything blocking progress.”</li> </ul> <p>You can also ask to speak to another Codex task, then ask to return to the previous one. For example, say, “Let me talk to the task reviewing the tests,” then, “Take me back to the previous task.” The destination task must support voice and be available on a connected host.</p> <p>ChatGPT Voice follows the same <a href=\"#/article/a-907da152b64948d8\">permissions</a> as the tasks it directs in Chat, Work, and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app.</p> <h2 id=\"show-chatgpt-what-you-see\">Show ChatGPT what you see</h2> <p>On macOS, turn on <strong>Screen context</strong> in <strong>Settings &gt; Voice</strong>, then say, “Take a look at this.” ChatGPT can take an <a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38?anchor=permissions-and-safety\">appshot</a> of your frontmost window and use it as context. Your organization can disable this capability.</p> <p>An appshot can include the window's image and accessible text, including content outside the visible scroll area. macOS may request <strong>Screen &amp; System Audio Recording</strong> and <strong>Accessibility</strong> permissions. Avoid sharing windows that contain sensitive information, including text outside the visible scroll area.</p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-voice-and-voice-dictation\">ChatGPT Voice and voice dictation</h2> <p>Use ChatGPT Voice for a live conversation with ChatGPT. Use <a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=use-voice-dictation\">voice dictation</a> when you only want to turn speech into prompt text before sending it.</p> <h2 id=\"limits-and-troubleshooting\">Limits and troubleshooting</h2> <p>Only one voice chat can be active across the ChatGPT desktop app at a time. If you can't start a voice chat, confirm that ChatGPT Voice is available for your plan, rollout, and workspace. Then check microphone permissions and whether a voice chat is already active in another app window. If screen context isn't available, check <strong>Settings &gt; Voice</strong>, Appshots permissions, and your organization's restrictions.</p>"};
